  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Welcome, valued crew of the Extreme-depth Submergence Mining Vessel HZ-3280, to your first day on the job!\r\n\r\nThe object of this operation is the mining and extraction of tellurium from deep ocean sediment. You are at the forefront of the Company\u2019s push to dominate the market of this rare metal by tapping into a brand new source: the ocean floor.\r\n\r\nAs was covered in your contracts, the HZ-3280 is an exclusively remotely-operated vessel, meaning that propulsion and surfacing will be entirely under Company jurisdiction. For this operation, the vessel will remain stationary at a depth of approximately 600 meters from the days of July 27, 20XX to August 15, 20XX.\r\n\r\nShould your foreman wish to contact the Company for any reason, they may do so at the vessel\u2019s computer terminal. It is our top priority to provide prompt and effective assistance to our employees whenever needed. After all, you are our greatest assets!\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aefe4ce8e29b56429914158c21c0f2a, type: 2}
